      "subject": "CPU请求分发与NoC响应合并",
      "explanation": "从 CPU 到 NoC 的路径：i_drvFCPU -> cfifo0 -> cfifo2 -> select0 -> splitterChannel0/1 -> delay18/20 -> o_drv2NoCChanel0/1。从 NoC 到 CPU 的路径：i_drvFNoCChannel0/1 -> mutexRead -> cfifo1 -> cfifoOut -> o_drv2CPU。数据路径与事件路径并行，payload 数据（51位）随事件流动。",
